00:45:37.498 --> 00:45:38.498
Dixon?

00:45:38.523 --> 00:45:40.123
- Tuan Codron?
 - Ya.

00:45:41.014 --> 00:45:42.014
Baiklah.

00:45:44.403 --> 00:45:45.786
Baiklah, ke mana arahnya sekarang?

00:45:46.197 --> 00:45:47.197
Mereka datang.

00:45:49.603 --> 00:45:51.938
Baiklah, mari kita berpisah.
Ayo.

00:46:01.893 --> 00:46:02.887
Tunggu.

00:46:06.897 --> 00:46:09.355
Mereka berpisah.

00:46:09.525 --> 00:46:12.438
Gilbert, Valon... bersamaku.

00:46:13.781 --> 00:46:16.821
Sisanya bersamaku.

00:46:25.702 --> 00:46:27.737
Aku ingin kau melakukan
sesuatu untukku, mengerti?

00:46:29.000 --> 00:46:30.200
Ayo, masuk.

00:46:35.292 --> 00:46:37.674
Kau tetaplah di sini sampai aku
kembali dan menjemputmu, mengerti?

00:46:37.699 --> 00:46:39.334
Bagaimana jika kau tak kembali?

00:46:39.493 --> 00:46:40.493
Hai.

00:46:41.199 --> 00:46:42.500
Kapan hal itu pernah terjadi?

00:46:43.708 --> 00:46:44.708
Matikan saja.

00:46:46.897 --> 00:46:48.597
Kita akan melewati ini, mengerti?

00:48:20.448 --> 00:48:22.026
Sebelah sana.

00:50:51.395 --> 00:50:52.395
Berengsek.

00:51:44.301 --> 00:51:45.301
Ayo.

00:51:45.800 --> 00:51:46.800
Ayo pergi.

00:51:47.000 --> 00:51:48.000
Ayo.

00:51:51.299 --> 00:51:52.299
Lewat sini.

00:52:09.493 --> 00:52:11.481
Terima kasih kepada para Supporter:
--- Usi Mawaddah, Komar, Tio Ali Mudianto, Andi Juliardi,
